      {
        "id": 2,
        "name": "Pushin CLI v0.3.0",
        "author": {
          "id": 2,
          "type": "User",
          "avatar_url": "https://cdn.pushin.eu/-/avatars/u_033jgKZKCNGC2kCrD0IBBG/72d51f75",
          "html_url": "https://pushin.eu/pjullrich",
          "login": "pjullrich",
          "node_id": "REDACTED"
        },
        "body": "### Breaking changes\n\n- Review and comment commands take integer API IDs only. Responses retain the\n  internal string primary key as `node_id`; rendered tables and confirmations\n  show the integer ID used by subsequent commands.\n  Migration: IDs printed by `pun` <= 0.2.8 were `node_id` strings and are now\n  rejected. Get the integer ID from `pun pr reviews` / `pun pr comments`.\n\n### Added\n\n- Bulk `move-origin` scans the chosen directory and its direct subfolders,\n  with a repository picker, explicit\n  path selection, non-interactive updates, and a read-only preview.\n- `move-origin --keep-both` preserves the previous origin as `github`;\n  `--revert` restores saved fetch and push URLs for any Git origin.\n- Imports offer a matching local-checkout picker after completion, with\n  `--move-all`, `--select`, `--directory`, `--keep-both`, and `--revert` options.\n- GitHub imports accept `GH_TOKEN`, taking precedence over `GITHUB_TOKEN`.\n  Empty token variables are skipped before falling back to `gh auth token`.\n\n### Changed\n\n- Remote configuration changes are staged on a temporary copy and published\n  under a brief Git config lock so a failed write leaves the config intact.\n- The origin backup keeps the last source outside Pushin through ordinary\n  Pushin retargets and reverts. Credentialed origins still replace the backup;\n  new Pushin URLs have no credentials and need no credential-specific prompt.\n- Import failures take priority over errors in the local-origin post-step,\n  with the import summary and retry hint printed last.\n- GitHub repository lookup and clone errors suggest `gh auth status` and\n  `gh repo view owner/repo` to diagnose authentication and repository access.",
        "url": "https://pushin.eu/api/v1/repos/pjullrich/pushin-cli/releases/2",
        "updated_at": "2026-10-13T15:27:08.545185Z",
        "tag_name": "v0.3.0",
        "created_at": "2026-10-13T15:27:03.089841Z",
